`gate_compute.per_check` windows 32–40 ms, budgets exact ({gc[0]} / {gc[1]} / {gc[2]}). Main streams: {events[0]}/{events[1]}/{events[2]} events (inside the 5–40 cap), strictly increasing `t_rel_ms` only (no `t_ms` mix), same-channel refractory ≥0.8 ms (184 DO pair at 1.3 ms, 185 pellistor pair at 1.2 ms, 186 radar pair at 1.5 ms).